---
source: crates/connector-vmm/src/launch.rs
expression: table
---
/ is writable; the VMM container must be launched with `--read-only`
/rootfs is writable; the VMM container must be launched with `--mount type=volume,source=V,destination=/rootfs,readonly`
/tmp/connector-mounts-0/mount-acme is writable; the VMM container must be launched with `--mount type=bind,source=M,target=M,readonly`
